00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:10.860
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.610
Amazing!

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.150
Henri-sensei!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.390
Excellent.

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.480
It's really a splendid cake.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.480
T-Thank you very much.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.860
closed captions

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.230
I wasn't wrong in choosing you.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:19.490
Ichigo, you're truly an excellent pâtissière.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:23.410
Wow, I'm being praised by Henri-sensei...

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.250
Amano-san. Amano-san!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.520
Amano-san, the cream is...

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:40.170
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:40.170
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

