yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.490
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.970
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.970
#Wasurenai@irc.rizon.net

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:08.070
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.620
W-What should I do!?

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:16.570
You're amazing.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:22.200
To daydream about other things even during cooking practical... what incredible guts.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.210
Kashino's sarcasm is starting again.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.310
Kashino.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.670
Stop being mean to Ichigo-chan.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:35.210
Although she failed on the decoration, the genoise is made perfectly.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:39.250
It's a great improvement compared to when you just transferred here.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.440
Thanks Hanabusa-kun, Andou-kun.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:47.240
Thank goodness I secretly practiced baking genoise in the middle of the night.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:48.420
How naïve.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:51.350
You're too naïve if you think that doing this little is an improvement.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:57.420
Kashino brushes off my efforts completely.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.530
D-Did you make that, Kashino?

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:03.550
Yeah.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.940
Amazing, right?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.210
When it comes to chocolate sweets, no one can make it better than Kashino.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:14.230
Wow, I also want to make chocolate cakes like this someday.

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:16.700
For Amano, it will still be impossible even after a million years.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.010
You're harsh!

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.720
Kashino, you meanie!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.040
I'll definitely make perfect sweets next time,

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:32.870
and give that devil the shock of his life!

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:39.240
recipe 5

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:39.240
Angels? Devils? Spirits??

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.240
Wow, how cute. Are we making this cake today?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:48.320
Yeah, next week's self study test is on designing chocolate cakes, right?

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:50.620
So I thought I'll make it like this cake.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.630
It's perfect. With this, you'll definitely pass.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:04:02.130
Although the test is important, what I really want is to give the devil a shock with my chocolate cake.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.150
Delicious.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:09.730
It's delicious! You're a genius, Amano.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.640
I plead you, please tell me the recipe for this delicious chocolate cake!

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.800
Please, I beg you. I beg you!

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.150
It's a million years too early for you.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.620
Something like that.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:24.520
All right. I'm going to make a delicious chocolate roll cake!

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.160
Yeah!

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:29.680
I must use a rectangle iron tray to make the roll cake's soufflé, right?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.210
This time I'm making a chocolate soufflé with chocolate batter.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.520
When adding on the strawberry cream, put lots of it on side closest to yourself.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:41.170
This way, when rolled it will turn out beautifully.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.300
And for the finishing touch, it's chocolate.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.130
When you've coated the top of the roll cake with it...

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.930
It's done!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.990
It looks delicious, right?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.010
Chocolate is a completed ingredient, I just need to melt it, that's all.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.050
It's actually quite simple.

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:58.030
Then, let's start eating!

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.480
Somehow, it doesn't taste right.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.670
The soufflé and strawberry cream are very delicious, but...

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:15.340
The chocolate cream that we added at the end is not delicious.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:19.170
How do I put it... it feels rough on my tongue and leaves a bad taste in my mouth.

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:24.510
Hey, how about making the chocolate cream again?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.590
Yeah, let's do that.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.110
This doesn't work either.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.970
Or this.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:34.900
Or that.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.240
Nor this one.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:43.260
I never thought that chocolate is this hard to make.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.240
Why can't I make it delicious?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.990
Devil, don't laugh at me!

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.960
Are you alright, Ichigo?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.190
I'm alright!

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.670
Really?

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.610
I am not alright...

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.990
What should I do, Vanilla!?

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:04.790
Chocolate is the main part of the cake. And I can't make that crucial ingredient delicious at all.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:09.940
I'm sorry, Ichigo. I don't know much about chocolate.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.310
I'm sure it would work out if Chocolat was here.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.540
Chocolat?

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:21.680
A-Are you all right, Vanilla!?

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:27.320
Seems like I ate too much chocolate.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:28.880
I'm sorry, Vanilla.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.320
Let's stop here for today and return to the room.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:33.940
Yeah.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.320
It's really cold at 5am.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.340
Oh, did someone come here already?

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.670
It's the devil Kashino!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.780
What is this?

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:02.780
Don't stand there spellbound.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.600
Close the door quickly, will you?

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.600
The cold air will get in.

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:09.280
Chocolate is very sensitive to the temperature.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.590
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:14.620
Oh man... I made the devil angry so early in the morning.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.730
But what is Kashino making?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.780
That's tempering!

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:25.850
Amazing. That's the difficult thing that professionals do, right?

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:29.790
To do this, you have to practice everyday so it'll be ingrained in your body.

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:34.410
I see, even though he is called the genius chocolatier,

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:37.890
Kashino practices his skills constantly without anyone noticing.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.890
Amano, did you give up already?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.830
You practice late at night, right?

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.330
Eh? You knew about that!?

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:45.720
Yeah.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.550
But yesterday I went to sleep earlier.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:53.890
Kashino knew that I was having special trainings late at night.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:59.370
But if he knew about it, why couldn't he acknowledge my efforts a little more!?

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:07.570
You fool!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:11.090
You're supposed to only warm the chocolate. Why are you using boiling water?

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:13.840
Umm...

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.350
I thought the chocolate will melt faster if its hotter...

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.360
I shouldn't?

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.850
Of course, you shouldn't!

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.210
The chocolate, you know, will separate if the temperature is too high.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:27.860
In order to not exceed 60°C, you have to constantly check it with a thermometer.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.350
I-I see...

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:33.250
Moreover that way you're handling it, a large amount of steam will condense into the chocolate.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.850
Steam?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.520
Chocolate can't have even a drop of water in it.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:41.580
You've to take extra care with the steam that raises from the pot.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.580
If this fails, the quality of the
chocolate will immediately drop.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:52.460
I see. That's why the chocolate I made last night wasn't delicious.

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.900
That's the most basic of basics!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:59.430
For the moment, Amano. Read the books for complete beginners and then redo it.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.470
Yes!

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.960
Umm...

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.480
Ensure that the water temperature doesn't exceed 60°C.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:11.980
It's completed, let me try it...

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:19.490
It's delicious. The mouth melting sensation of the chocolate is completely different from before.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:23.170
U-Umm, Kashino.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.560
Thank you for instructing me earlier.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.560
It's nothing.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:33.210
It'll be troubling if you cause the entire A-group's grades to drop.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.660
So, that's the reason, huh?

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.480
Amano, you know.

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:41.560
How much chocolate have you wasted recently?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.730
You have to value ingredients better.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:50.360
If you continue like that, before you can fail as a pâtissière, you'll first fail as a human.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.580
Here, try this.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.430
Wow, it's delicious!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:02.240
Such creamy chocolate, it's my first time eating something like this.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.240
Let's me have more.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:04.980
Enough for you.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.250
Meanie...

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.150
You can just make it yourself, right?

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.250
First you have to keep practicing daily.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.750
Or do you want me to repeat myself?

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.370
Saying that it will still be impossible for Amano even after a million years.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:23.470
I'm going then. Turn off the lights and fans when you leave, small mustache.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:24.760
Small mustache?

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:27.490
Ah!

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:29.790
I'm done in!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.980
You devil, how many times are you gonna make a fool of me?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:39.710
I'll definitely make super delicious cake!

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:53.500
P-Praline? Umm...

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:55.360
Praline = confection made of nuts and syrup.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.360
What's this word?

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.980
So you're here...

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.520
Oh, isn't this a French book?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:05.380
So why is Ichigo reading such a difficult book?

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:09.840
Well, I thought I'll choose from this book for the test on chocolate cakes.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:10.520
Huh?

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:13.390
Have you given up on the chocolate roll cake you made before?

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.020
Yeah, I gave it up.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:20.020
A while ago, I tried a mouthful of the chocolate Kashino made.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:25.360
Though it was only a mouthful, but it was so delicious that I realized I was being naïve.

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:29.790
The childish roll cake I made doesn't stand a chance against Kashino.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.870
I must make a chocolate cake with much higher standards.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.620
But I thought that the roll cake from before is kinda good.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.380
How do I put it, it's more like Ichigo's style.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:38.550
Thanks.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:41.750
I will make that cake again for a snack next time, okay?

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.890
Oh yeah.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:45.380
I have something that I want you to see.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:48.030
Wow, it's chocolate crafts!

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:49.900
I did my best to make these.

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:53.430
You made these? Amazing. You did well.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.730
This cabbage too, it looks so real.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.790
Cabbage!?

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.510
That's a rose!

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:00.370
Rose?

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.370
I'm sorry.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:05.090
But these slippers looks real too.

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:07.740
Those aren't slippers, it's Cinderella's glass shoes!

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:10.160
T-These are glass shoes?

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.750
T-Then...

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.320
This is a gourd, right?

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.070
It's a ribbon.

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:16.540
How about this big Shimeji?

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:17.340
Shimeji = type of mushroom

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:17.340
A castle.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.630
How about the natto in the box?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.750
A jewelry box.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:28.860
It's not good... I wanted to use crafts to compete with Kashino but..

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:32.050
as I thought, it didn't work out as well as I hoped.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.570
Yeah, maybe it just needs more work.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:42.790
Even if chocolate crafts don't work, I can still compete with a delicious chocolate cake.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.770
All right, I'll re-energize and do my best!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.270
Fight, Ichigo!

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:51.800
Vanilla. Please check this word for me.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:54.410
Another word that you don't know?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.920
I'm sorry, my hands are tied right now.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.100
It's finally time for the chocolate.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.900
Vanilla, check this word for me too.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:12.830
I'm sure taking a long time...

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:17.150
No, I shouldn't. I must finish it.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:20.750
The temperature must be below 60°C, right?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.690
The chocolate is...

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:30.330
Have to redo...

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.770
Hey, Amano.

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:38.540
Are you alright, Amano?

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:41.250
K-Kashino?

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.830
I'm sorry, I'm alright already.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.000
You haven't slept much for the last few days, have you?

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.850
You're staggering so much...

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.350
Huh?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.780
The Royal Purveyor Chocolate Torte indeed.

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:58.680
Are you planning to make this?

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.040
It's still impossible. Such a difficult cake...

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.370
It isn't impossible!

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.760
It isn't impossible. I'll make it.

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.830
I'm a member of A-group too after all.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.870
No, I don't want to cry in front of Kashino.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:14.270
But my tears keep falling on their own.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.860
My uncle is a chocolatier.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:24.380
When I was a child, I often spent time at my uncle's shop.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:27.380
Looking at how he tempered with the chocolate until it shines.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.890
It's exciting to see multi-coloured chocolates that turned out.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.610
I even thought that it was like magic.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.000
Moreover, when I helped to clean up,

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.940
I was even rewarded.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.450
Here.

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:44.250
Hot chocolate?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.070
Drink, it'll calm you down. You've been working on the cake the entire night, right?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.080
It's delicious...

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:59.280
I made this by melting the remaining chocolate from bowls and utensils with hot milk.

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:03.750
This way, it'll be easier to clean the utensils and it won't waste the chocolate.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:07.140
This idea is something my uncle would think of.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.090
Your uncle really likes chocolates, right?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.470
Yeah.

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:15.630
The chocolates that my uncle makes reflects his soul.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:19.600
It might be my admiration for him that brought me here.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:24.100
Thanks for the meal. It's mysterious, it feels like I've regained my energy.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.720
That's good.

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:30.610
Chocolate contains arginine and theobromine that makes you feel re-energized.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.230
I see.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:38.120
Though I've been troubled about chocolates lately, but now I'm cheered up because of it.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.740
Maybe this might be some of your uncle's magic?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.060
Don't rush it, Amano.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:48.520
You just have to find your own magic.

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:51.280
Angel?

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:55.540
It looks like Kashino has huge white wings spread out, just like an angel!

00:15:56.150 --> 00:16:01.180
I've always thought he was a devil, but then he did say such kind words...

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:06.400
Thank goodness, Ichigo is feeling better again.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.610
Yeah, that chocolate totally cheered me up.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.530
Huh? By chocolate?

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:18.540
Chocolates, you know...contains Ar..something and something something..mine that can re-energize people.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:23.560
Oh? I don't really get it, but Ichigo looks best with a smile.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.540
Let's nail tomorrow's test too.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.580
Test?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.580
Ah, I forgot!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.130
Hey, are you sure that you'll be fine?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.550
Y-Yeah it's alright. It's alright.

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:40.290
Despite the things we've said about him, Kashino has really taught me a lot about chocolates.

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:43.840
I don't know if I'll find my magic,

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:50.480
but like my grandmother and Kashino's uncle, I too will try making creations with all my heart and soul.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:02.660
Eh? In the end, you still made the same chocolate roll as before, right?

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:06.710
Yeah. But I will make it with an even more delicious arrangement.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:09.170
This colour, this smell!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.260
You've changed it to bitter chocolate.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.380
Yeah. I made it slightly bitter.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:19.730
Wow! You're even adding in fruits. They're sparkling like jewels.

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:22.900
Then you roll the cake up and... it's complete!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:26.390
Looks good. Now for the final touch with chocolate, right?

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:27.990
Yeah.

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:31.110
Sensei, I'm done.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.620
Let me see, let me see.

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:37.360
Maccha mixed chocolate on Maccha sponge cake.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.330
In it, I added Maccha mousse and red bean paste.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:43.520
I see. It's a new style with Japanese flavour.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:45.830
Sensei, please have a look at mine, too.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:50.200
It's made of raspberry chocolate and decorated with a flower.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:54.340
In it there's franboise and mascarpone, giving it a sweet and sour taste.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.030
The decoration is really beautiful.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.840
Sensei, please have a look over here, too.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.940
Wow, this is...

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:03.630
I arranged it like the opera.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.730
This is fun.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.960
Step by step it gets completed.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.940
This process is really fun.

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.620
There, I used it all up nicely.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.710
Wastefulness is a disgrace.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.710
Give that to me, I'll wash it.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.950
Eh? It's fine, I'll do it myself.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.630
Listen up. You just focus on its completion.

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:35.590
If you are slow, A-group's cleaning up will be delayed as well.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:38.450
Eh? Oops, I'm sorry.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.120
Moreover,

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:42.640
this time you didn't leave any chocolate wasted in the bowl, so washing up is easy.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.130
Thanks.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:47.140
That's enough, just get back to work.

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:48.090
Yes.

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:57.570
Bitter and sweet, Angel and Devils. By mixing everything together, I'll give you a delicious moment.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.410
With my magic, that is.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:01.950
It's done!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.770
Vanilla, it's done. Come on out.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:08.420
Wow, amazing, it looks really delicious!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:11.830
I must add this to our collection, too.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:20.160
We did it.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:20.690
Yeah.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:25.600
Now when I think of it, doesn't this cake look a little like Kashino's?

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:26.050
Eh?

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:27.220
Really?

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.890
That never crossed my mind.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.060
I don't think it looks like his at all.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.240
Ah, the teacher is coming. Ichigo, good luck.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.700
Sensei, here please.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.700
Amano-san's cake is finally completed.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.880
Yes. It's an Angel and Devil fruit roll.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.060
Angel and Devil?

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:49.560
It has a sweet milky white chocolate and bitter chocolate.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:53.590
It's a different cake where you can taste both types of chocolate together.

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:56.090
So, let's taste the cakes then.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.580
Taste? Wow. Can I really eat everyone's cakes!?

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.840
Ichigo-chan, this roll cake is delicious.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:14.520
Yes, it's good. The two chocolates created a good balance.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:15.750
Really?

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:21.900
Kashino. I wonder what he thinks of my cake?

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:25.200
Come on. Tell us that it's delicious, Kashino.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.700
The cream is stiff, you beat it too much.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:30.370
Eh?

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:33.540
But, among everything that Amano has made till now...

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:35.740
...this is the most delicious.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.210
Did you just say delicious?

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.130
Y-Yeah.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.460
Really? You're not just thinking that it's ordinary or something?

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:43.990
I'm honestly praising you!

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:47.500
He rarely praises people, so he's embarrassed.

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:52.480
I did it! Thank you, Kashino.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:57.000
Though I'm still far from being like everyone else, at least I'm being acknowledged a little.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.310
I won't acknowledge you though.

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:00.800
That childish cake..

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:02.490
Hey, Chocolat...

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.440
T-That is, it can't be...

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:12.000
Amano Ichigo, how dare you get conceited just because you've been praised by Kashino!?

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:15.820
Kashino has a Sweets Spirit helping him out?

