What kind of decorations will you make?

00:24:00.590 --> 00:24:03.930
I thought I was the only one having a Sweets Spirits?

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:08.520
Kashino and the others, along with their Sweets Spirits, everyone is working hard towards their dreams.

00:24:08.520 --> 00:24:09.870
I have to do my best too!

00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:13.410
Eh? Ringo-chan? Same as I, she's also named after fruits.

00:24:13.410 --> 00:24:16.370
But Ringo-chan is probably feeling lonely in her kindergarten.

00:24:16.370 --> 00:24:18.700
Just like when I first transferred to St. Marie Academy.

00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:23.350
All right! To bring back Ringo-chan's smile, I'll make her a birthday cake!

